#description: Defaulted fields at the top, in a nested struct, in a list element and in a map value. Every program reading an instance sees each default the instance omits.
#version: 0.0
#spec: docs/translation.md:49
#expect/empty: ok
#expect/priority-given: ok
#expect/shipping-express: ok
#expect/item-without-quantity: ok
#expect/label-without-weight: ok
#expect/item-without-sku: E0501
#known/cue/item-without-quantity: #295 Value decodes the data onto NewT, which decodes the schema alone, so a default in a list element is never set.
#known/cue/label-without-weight: #295 Value decodes the data onto NewT, which decodes the schema alone, so a default in a map value is never set.
#description/empty: Every field is filled: priority 3, shipping.method standard, items [].
#description/item-without-quantity: The item's quantity is filled with 1: a default in a list element.
#description/label-without-weight: The label's weight is filled with 1: a default in a map value.
-- defaults/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	priority: *3 | int
	shipping: {
		method: *"standard" | "express"
	}
	items: [...{
		sku:      string
		quantity: *1 | int
	}]
	labels?: [string]: {
		weight: *1 | int
	}
}
-- data/empty.json --
{}
-- data/priority-given.json --
{"priority":7}
-- data/shipping-express.json --
{"shipping":{"method":"express"}}
-- data/item-without-quantity.json --
{"items":[{"sku":"ABC-0001"}]}
-- data/label-without-weight.json --
{"labels":{"gift":{}}}
-- data/item-without-sku.json --
{"items":[{"quantity":2}]}
-- out/cue/empty --
verdict: ok
value: {"priority":3,"shipping":{"method":"standard"},"items":[]}
-- out/cue/item-without-quantity --
verdict: E0901
E0901 the Go value differs from the instance @ no position
-- out/cue/item-without-sku --
verdict: E0501
E0501 the data lacks items.0.sku, which schema 0.0 declares as string @ data/item-without-sku.json:1:1
-- out/cue/label-without-weight --
verdict: E0901
E0901 the Go value differs from the instance @ no position
-- out/cue/priority-given --
verdict: ok
value: {"priority":7,"shipping":{"method":"standard"},"items":[]}
-- out/cue/shipping-express --
verdict: ok
value: {"priority":3,"shipping":{"method":"express"},"items":[]}
